    "name": {
      "value": "Major Magnetic Suit"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "g&g"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This magnetized suit is strapped to your body over your armor or clothes. When you Activate it, you must choose whether to set it to attract or repel. The activation lasts 10 minutes.\n\nWhile set to attract, you take a –1 status penalty to your AC against attacks made by metal weapons, while allies within a 10-foot emanation other than you gain a +1 status bonus to their AC. If set to repel, you gain a +1 status bonus to AC against attacks made with metal weapons. While attracting metal, you gain a +1 status bonus to Athletics checks to Climb metal objects and Grapple metal creatures and a –1 status penalty to Athletics checks to Shove metal creatures. While repelling metal, you gain a +1 status bonus to Athletics checks to Shove metal creatures, but you take a –1 status penalty to Climb metal objects and Grapple metal creatures.\n\nThe area that gains an AC bonus when attracting is a 20-foot emanation, and the item bonuses and penalties increase from 1 to 3.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact"
    },
